{
  "title": "About Fish Picker Plugin",
  "plugin": "fish-picker",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "9795db2e8f0e1e18",
      "text": "The **Fish Picker Plugin** is the site identity flag editor. A site owner opens it from the hitchhiker Tools page and chooses a parametric Mice & Fish flag \u2014 colour and school by topic, species by person, markings by individual \u2014 which is written to `status/favicon.png` with the choice recorded in a PNG `tEXt` chunk so it can be read back and re-edited."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "f4374df69fb7877f",
      "text": "It exposes `window.plugins.fishPicker` and nothing else. The hitchhiker Tools page offers the Fish button only when that object exists, so a farm without this plugin simply has no Fish button \u2014 loose coupling in both directions. Owner only; the write goes through the wiki's own favicon route."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "307aa8c5848909a3",
      "text": "Extracted from [[About Hitchhiker Plugin]]'s `wiki-ux.js` in August 2026. Built with esbuild; the served file is about 7 KB."
    },
